  "description": "The merge of the Fuaran op-stream DAG, which is Fuaran.Core's DAG over the op envelope: a thin reconciliation policy over Core's conflict report (agreement, a declared child-order rule, a reorder rebase, every other interfering pair refused with a typed envelope), an optional precedence-as-script side, the validator gate, and Core's replay, checkpoints and compaction bound to the tier. A merge node records its script and is checked to replay to the derived tree. Requires IDagOpStreamSink, so DAG behaviour is structurally unreachable from the linear path. Apache-2.0 licensed.",
  "id": "Fuaran.UI.OpStream.Dag.Merge",
